§§ `s 105 -- discriminatory conduct`

#ASSERT `Is it discriminatory conduct` `worker` `I was dismissed` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it discriminatory conduct` `worker` `my contract for services was terminated` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it discriminatory conduct` `worker` `my position was altered to my detriment` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it discriminatory conduct` `prospective` `I was refused or not offered engagement` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it discriminatory conduct` `prospective` `I was treated less favourably than another prospective worker in the terms offered` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it discriminatory conduct` `commercial` `a commercial arrangement with me was terminated` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Is it discriminatory conduct` `worker` `they refused or failed to enter into a commercial arrangement with me` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A head that does not fit the person: (a) needs a worker, (b) a prospective worker.
#ASSERT `Is it discriminatory conduct` `prospective` `I was dismissed` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is it discriminatory conduct` `worker` `I was refused or not offered engagement` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Is it discriminatory conduct` `worker` `something else` EQUALS JUST FALSE

