§§ `ss 31-34, 34C, 34D -- which offence`

-- Arguments: duty; duty only as worker or person at workplace; volunteer; unincorporated association; business or
-- officer; failed; exposed to risk; caused death; grossly negligent; reckless; no reasonable excuse.
#ASSERT `Which offence was it` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `industrial manslaughter`
-- A death, but recklessness rather than gross negligence: Category 1, not industrial manslaughter.
#ASSERT `Which offence was it` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS `a Category 1 offence`
-- A worker (not a business or officer) grossly negligent, causing a death: Category 1.
#ASSERT `Which offence was it` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `a Category 1 offence`
-- Gross negligence with a reasonable excuse: not Category 1; Category 2.
#ASSERT `Which offence was it` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS `a Category 2 offence`
#ASSERT `Which offence was it` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `a Category 2 offence`
#ASSERT `Which offence was it` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `a Category 3 offence`
#ASSERT `Which offence was it` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no offence under Part 2 or Part 2A on these facts`
#ASSERT `Which offence was it` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no offence under Part 2 or Part 2A on these facts`
-- A volunteer officer: no offence for a duty other than ss 28, 29 (s 34(1)), no industrial manslaughter (s 34D).
#ASSERT `Which offence was it` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no offence under Part 2 or Part 2A on these facts`
-- A volunteer worker under s 28: Category 1, never industrial manslaughter.
#ASSERT `Which offence was it` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `a Category 1 offence`
-- An unincorporated association (s 34(2)).
#ASSERT `Which offence was it` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS `no offence under Part 2 or Part 2A on these facts`

